        "intro_highlight": "The TM-3 Standard brings high-efficiency utility to busy treatment rooms through solid North American engineering and localized workstation integration. Designed to support heavy daily operational demand, this all-metal service station resolves space constraints while keeping critical aesthetic tools organized and directly accessible to the practitioner.",
