        "subtitle": "Industrial-Grade Professional Organization",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Durable powder-coated steel construction is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the clean aesthetic and smooth surface finish of TM-3 Standard, clean daily with non-abrasive surface disinfectants formulated for clinical environments. The stain-resistant metal surfaces resist chemical exposure and daily wear, ensuring optimal condition across decades of heavy use. Consistent care maintains smooth mobility and prevents surface corrosion.</p>",
