          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Aestheticians:",
            "answer": "<p>For clinical aestheticians running back-to-back facial protocols, the TM-3 Standard provides three wide 14\" x 23\" shelves, giving immediate access to high-frequency units, skin analyzers, and steamers. By keeping all vital devices within arm's reach and powered through a single 6-outlet power bar, technicians maintain continuous focus on precise skin extractions and client comfort.</p>"
          }
        },
        "application_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Lash & Brow Specialists:",
            "answer": "<p>Lash artists and brow technicians require absolute station stability and rapid access to intricate micro-tools during extended, fine-detail appointments. The TM-3 Standard's rigid metallic construction eliminates wobble when reaching for tools, while integrated magnifying lamp holders allow optimal lighting positioning directly over the client area. This tool-less integration reduces visual fatigue and neck tension, speeding up procedure times while ensuring consistent, high-precision results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "application_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Tattoo Artists & Cosmetic Injectors:",
            "answer": "<p>For tattoo practitioners and cosmetic injectors needing an easily sanitized, ultra-mobile workstation, the TM-3 Standard delivers effortless room navigation via non-marking, ultra-quiet casters. The non-porous metal surfaces allow for rapid, hospital-grade disinfection between clients, eliminating cross-contamination risks. Having a stable, mobile base ensures that sterile supplies, pigment trays, and topical solutions remain completely secure throughout delicate procedures.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
